### Récupérer un access token Keycloak (password grant)
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/takalo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = password &
client_id = takalo-backend &
username = admin &
password = adminadmin

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

### Préparer une catégorie
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Épicerie"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("category_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Préparer un produit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pâtes complètes",
  "categoryId": "{{category_id}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("product_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Préparer un budget source
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Achats Avril",
  "fond": 1000.00
}

> {%
    client.global.set("budget_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Préparer un budget cible (pour réassignation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Achats Mai",
  "fond": 800.00
}

> {%
    client.global.set("target_budget_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Créer un achat (cas nominal — budget explicite)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15T10:30:00Z",
  "budgetId": "{{budget_id}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": 2.50,
      "quantity": 3,
      "discount": 0.50,
      "expiryDate": "2026-12-31",
      "storeName": "Carrefour Antananarivo"
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("purchase_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Créer un achat — budget absent (utilise le budget par défaut)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15T11:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": 1.00,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Créer un achat — budgetId explicitement null (aucun budget)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15T12:00:00Z",
  "budgetId": null,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": 1.20,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Créer un achat — date future (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2099-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": 1.00,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Créer un achat — items vide (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15T10:00:00Z",
  "items": []
}

### Créer un achat — quantité non positive (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15T10:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": 1.00,
      "quantity": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Créer un achat — prix unitaire négatif (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15T10:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": -1.00,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Créer un achat — produit inconnu (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15T10:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "unitPrice": 1.00,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Obtenir un achat par id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/{{purchase_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Obtenir un achat — id inconnu (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Rechercher des achats (sans filtre)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Rechercher des achats — fenêtre [start, end[
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases?start=2026-04-01T00:00:00Z&end=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Rechercher des achats — pagination personnalisée
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Mettre à jour un achat
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/{{purchase_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-16T09:00:00Z",
  "budgetId": "{{budget_id}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": 2.20,
      "quantity": 4,
      "storeName": "Shoprite"
    }
  ]
}

### Mettre à jour un achat — id inconnu (404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-16T09:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{product_id}}",
      "unitPrice": 1.00,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Réassigner un achat à un autre budget
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/{{purchase_id}}/budget
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "budgetId": "{{target_budget_id}}",
  "date": "2026-04-20T10:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Bascule sur le budget de mai"
}

### Réassigner un achat — budgetId manquant (400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/{{purchase_id}}/budget
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-20T10:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Invalide"
}

### Réassigner un achat — raison vide (400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/{{purchase_id}}/budget
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "budgetId": "{{target_budget_id}}",
  "date": "2026-04-20T10:00:00Z",
  "raison": "   "
}

### Réassigner un achat — achat inconnu (404)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/budget
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "budgetId": "{{target_budget_id}}",
  "date": "2026-04-20T10:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Test"
}

### Importer des achats — fichier CSV (multipart)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/import
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----TakaloBoundary

------TakaloBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="achats.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/achats.csv
------TakaloBoundary--

### Importer des achats — fichier XLSX (multipart)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/import
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----TakaloBoundary

------TakaloBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="achats.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./samples/achats.xlsx
------TakaloBoundary--

### Importer des achats — extension non supportée (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases/import
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----TakaloBoundary

------TakaloBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="achats.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

contenu inutile
------TakaloBoundary--

### Sans authentification (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/purchases
